                    <msContents>
                        <summary> This manuscript has 5 distinct "works". Including an incomplete copy of Thesaurus spirituum, preceded by an incomplete 'Ars notoria' in English, and followed by extracts from works on magical experiments, ceremonial magic, etc.: in Latin and English.</summary>
                        <textLang mainLang="la" source="IANA">Latin</textLang>
                    </msContents>
